    <string name="legal_title">Terms &amp; Privacy</string>
    <string name="privacy_summary">Privacy Policy: The application does not collect, store, process, or transfer personal data to third parties. Microphone permission is used only for on-device real-time sound level measurement. Audio recordings are not stored, transmitted, or shared. No account registration is required, and no personally identifiable information is requested.</string>
    <string name="terms_summary">Terms of Use: This application is provided for informational and general reference purposes. Measurements may vary depending on device hardware, microphone quality, system processing, and environmental conditions. The app is not a certified professional measuring instrument and should not be used where legal, regulatory, medical, occupational safety, or compliance-grade measurements are required.</string>
